Description: adaptation-samsung-gts7xlwifi - meta
 Samsung Galaxy Tab S7+ Wi-Fi (SM-T970, codename gts7xlwifi) api30
 adaptation metapackage. Depends on the kernel bootimage, the Halium
 hybris API-30 phone runtime, and this device's adaptation configs.

Package: adaptation-samsung-gts7xlwifi-configs
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends},
Description: Samsung Galaxy Tab S7+ Wi-Fi (gts7xlwifi)'s specific adaptation configs
 Device-specific configuration files (udev rules, phosh compositor settings,
 device flag files, hwcomposer/audio glue) for the Samsung Galaxy Tab S7+
 Wi-Fi (gts7xlwifi) running Droidian on top of a Halium-12 / Android-11
 vendor partition.
